---
// Founder story. One paragraph, no names, no team section.
//
// Deliberate constraints: the critique lands on the software category, never on
// any club, and nothing here implies a club has partnered with us, reviewed the
// product, or given feedback. The experience is a founder's own.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import DemoCTA from '../components/DemoCTA.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Athletic Connect exists because the software sold to youth sports is not built to run a program end to end."
  path="/about/"
>
  <section class="ahead pad">
    <div class="wrap center">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our story</div>
      <h1>We built the system we couldn't buy.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        Athletic Connect comes out of one founder's years running a basketball
        program, and the conclusion any director reaches after enough seasons:
        the software sold to youth sports is not built to run a program end to
        end. Registration is one product, scheduling is another, payments are a
        third, and spreadsheets tie everything together. Copying and pasting,
        reconciling across systems, and remembering where everything goes all
        fall on the humans who make programs run.
      </p>
      <p>
        We decided to close the gap rather than keep working around it. Athletic
        Connect is what it looks like when one system covers the whole season, so
        the work goes back to the sports and the players, and the paperwork stops
        being your evening.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <DemoCTA
    heading="Want to see it?"
    sub="Tell us how your program runs today and we'll show you what it looks like in one place."
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .ahead {
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        1000px 460px at 50% -20%,
        rgba(252, 66, 4, 0.1),
        rgba(252, 66, 4, 0) 60%
      ),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, var(--wash) 100%);
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .story {
    padding: 52px 0 66px;
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 660px;
  }
  .prose p {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }
</style>
